{"3719690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "YOU DO NOT EXIST", "steam_appid": 3719690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719690/extras/d58216632e36f97ae6a87f6c00604c18.avif?t=1762381212\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU DO NOT EXIST IS A SCI-FI ROGUELITE SET IN THE NEAR FUTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to the efforts of major corporations, humanity has expanded across the inner solar system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crime and civil unrest have increased to uncontrollable levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mars is on the brink of revolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Concerned with recent blows dealt to galactic expansion, the governments of Earth and Mars responded with the establishment of humanity’s largest-ever bounty hunting social program: <strong>Bounties&amp;Hunters</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the state of the future as Birdy, a small-time bounty hunter seeking a better life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719690/extras/5cdf3aecb3e7e38cfe98588204ea9971.webp?t=1762381212\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719690/extras/5cdf3aecb3e7e38cfe98588204ea9971.poster.avif?t=1762381212\" class=\"bb_img\" width=563 height=331 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JOIN THE PROGRAM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the bounty hunting program and work alongside Ruby, your personal dispatcher, to hunt down deadly targets and shut down the impending Martian Revolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up jobs, read about humanity’s latest ventures, and acquire gear all through Birdy’s Personal Terminal. Explore Mars through procedurally generated levels, and attempt to complete runs with a diverse arsenal of upgradable weapons and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719690/extras/66c79686b8a6c400528f09f072c35f44.avif?t=1762381212\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO THE FUTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make friends (or foes) with Martian Revolutionaries, Corporate Mercenaries, and citizens caught in the crossfire as you navigate through a planet-wide political conflict.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy features such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Experimental Art Style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character-Driven Narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric Procedurally Generated Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse, Upgradable Player Arsenal</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719690/extras/6a0601c48bcf379e23c443d7e3c2bf6a.avif?t=1762381212\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719690/extras/d58216632e36f97ae6a87f6c00604c18.avif?t=1762381212\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU DO NOT EXIST IS A SCI-FI ROGUELITE SET IN THE NEAR FUTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to the efforts of major corporations, humanity has expanded across the inner solar system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crime and civil unrest have increased to uncontrollable levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mars is on the brink of revolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Concerned with recent blows dealt to galactic expansion, the governments of Earth and Mars responded with the establishment of humanity’s largest-ever bounty hunting social program: <strong>Bounties&amp;Hunters</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the state of the future as Birdy, a small-time bounty hunter seeking a better life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719690/extras/5cdf3aecb3e7e38cfe98588204ea9971.webp?t=1762381212\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719690/extras/5cdf3aecb3e7e38cfe98588204ea9971.poster.avif?t=1762381212\" class=\"bb_img\" width=563 height=331 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JOIN THE PROGRAM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the bounty hunting program and work alongside Ruby, your personal dispatcher, to hunt down deadly targets and shut down the impending Martian Revolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up jobs, read about humanity’s latest ventures, and acquire gear all through Birdy’s Personal Terminal. Explore Mars through procedurally generated levels, and attempt to complete runs with a diverse arsenal of upgradable weapons and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719690/extras/66c79686b8a6c400528f09f072c35f44.avif?t=1762381212\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO THE FUTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make friends (or foes) with Martian Revolutionaries, Corporate Mercenaries, and citizens caught in the crossfire as you navigate through a planet-wide political conflict.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy features such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Experimental Art Style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character-Driven Narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric Procedurally Generated Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse, Upgradable Player Arsenal</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719690/extras/6a0601c48bcf379e23c443d7e3c2bf6a.avif?t=1762381212\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p>", "short_description": "In the near future, galactic colonization has grown wild and untamable. Take on bounties, confront rivals, and find yourself in the middle of a terrible conspiracy as Birdy, a bounty hunter fighting for their future.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719690/1383d070df43e29f29646691429d9044bfc2d87a/header.jpg?t=1762381212", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719690/887b9ae45d4acd8768296a69768c86578189fe41/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762381212", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719690/887b9ae45d4acd8768296a69768c86578189fe41/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762381212", "website": "https://www.thirteenthmonthstudio.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Reco